      "relies": "Why `anthropics/claude-code-security-review` is not the engine of the security review: an API key only (`claude-api-key`), a retired default model, `@anthropic-ai/claude-code` and pip packages not pinned, a cache marker saved before the key is checked. A change here can lift a condition of its adoption.",
